# 詞: 睇怕

1. 我睇怕你唔會贏，所以唔敢買你贏嘅注。 (I'm afraid you won't win, so I didn't dare to bet on your victory.)
2. 佢個樣好兇，我睇怕佢會打人。 (He looks very fierce; I'm afraid he might hit people.)
3. 天氣好差，我睇怕今晚會落大雨。 (The weather is terrible; I'm afraid it will rain heavily tonight.)
4. 你咁遲先返嚟，我睇怕你唔會準時到。 (You're coming back so late; I'm afraid you won't arrive on time.)
5. 個醫生話病情好嚴重，我睇怕佢好唔會好轉。 (The doctor said the condition is very serious; I'm afraid he won't get better.)
6. 佢成日遲到，我睇怕佢今次又會放飛機。 (He's always late; I'm afraid he'll stand us up again this time.)
7. 個項目風險好大，我睇怕公司會蝕錢。 (The project is very risky; I'm afraid the company will lose money.)
8. 佢個眼神好冷，我睇怕佢對我有意見。 (His gaze is very cold; I'm afraid he has something against me.)
9. 電路好舊，我睇怕隨時會短路。 (The wiring is very old; I'm afraid it might short-circuit at any moment.)
10. 佢話會幫手，但我睇怕佢最後會反口。 (He said he would help, but I'm afraid he'll change his mind in the end.) [end of text]


